{"book":9,"chapter":14,"rubric":"DATABASES / INDEXES, CTES, WINDOWS AND VIEWS / CHAPTER 14","slides":[{"title":"Long queries","sub":"Chapter 14 · WITH","short":"Intro","main":"A CTE names an intermediate query, so a long query reads step by step.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Nesting doll","Step names","Same result"],"captions":["A subquery in a subquery in a subquery — read from the inside out","A CTE names every step: written before the main query","Read top to bottom like a story; the result is the same"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":85.0,"w":280.0,"h":90.0,"text":"","tone":"blue","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":85.0,"w":210.0,"h":64.0,"text":"","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":85.0,"w":140.0,"h":38.0,"text":"SELECT","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":35.0,"w":240.0,"h":24.0,"text":"step 1: totals by customer","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":180.0,"y":70.0,"w":240.0,"h":24.0,"text":"step 2: best customers","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":180.0,"y":105.0,"w":240.0,"h":24.0,"text":"step 3: add names","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"subqueries:\ninside out","tone":"yellow","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":70.0,"w":150.0,"h":36.0,"text":"CTE:\ntop to bottom","tone":"green","size":9.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[12.4,24.9]}]},{"title":"WITH … AS","sub":"Syntax","short":"WITH AS","main":"WITH name AS (SELECT …) SELECT … FROM name.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Expression","Usage","Lives for one query"],"captions":["WITH name AS (SELECT …) — the result gets a name","The main query uses the name like an ordinary table","The expression exists only for the query and is saved nowhere"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":14.0,"lines":["WITH totals AS ("